{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>On his day you shall give his wage.</b> After the completion of the work: if he is a day laborer, he pays him all night; and if a night laborer, he pays him all day. And so our Sages said: for here it says ולא תבוא עליו השמש, and in another place it says לא תלין פעולת שכיר אתך עד בוקר." "<b>For he is poor.</b> If he is poor." "<b>And to it he lifts his soul.</b> He longs for it, as in אליך ה׳ נפשי אשא."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:54:08.531214708Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}